                   },
                   "id": "Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIxMDc0ODkyNDQxNDI3ODA0MTY=",
                   "richtext": {
                    "richtext_tags": []
                   },
                   "text": "\ud83c\uddf5\ud83c\uddf9 I tried to make an Urban Terror map of Lisbon with Opus 5.5 and it worked!\n\nIt uses the real OSM maps data of the center area around Pra\u00e7a do Com\u00e9rcio with real buildings\n\nIt's not fully exact but a nice approximation, I've always wanted to be able to to multiplayer games in actual REAL cities with friends so now we can\n\nI put it as the main map on https://t.co/MohU4A8Zel now \ud83d\ude0a"
                  }
                 }
